# Agentforce Observability Lab

Educational, click-to-learn replica of Agentforce Studio **Observe & Optimize**. Live at https://af-observability.netlify.app/. Mock/seeded data only; no Salesforce org connection. Unofficial learning project.

## Product rules

- Recreate Observe & Optimize structure (Analytics, Sessions & Intents, Scorers, Alerts) closely enough to teach from.
- Nearly every button, metric, percentage, chart, tab, filter, column, toggle, and section must open an explanatory modal covering: what it is, how to read the value, purpose, use cases, concrete examples, and links to official Salesforce docs only.
- Prefer official sources: help.salesforce.com, developer.salesforce.com, trailhead.salesforce.com, architect.salesforce.com. Do not invent formulas or thresholds when docs do not state them.
- Keep the app deployable as a static teaching surface (HTML/React build). Instructor-reference disclaimer stays visible.

