## Origin prompts (Claude Code, AGT505 workshop)

**Brief 1**

Review the exercise guide and slides. Validate every exercise step against the disposable Salesforce trial org, documenting anything broken, outdated, renamed, or moved. Recreate the dashboards and observability features as a runnable HTML teaching app, matching the guide closely. Make every button, metric, percentage, chart, and section interactive. Each opens a modal explaining: what it represents, how to interpret values, purpose, practical use cases, concrete examples, and relevant official Salesforce documentation. Deliver the app with validation findings and corrected exercise steps.

**Brief 2**

Create a deployed, accessible HTML app. Recreate the dashboards and observability features from the guide verbatim so they can be explained to customers. Each button or section opens a modal explaining what numbers or percentages mean, use case, purpose, and examples, linked to official documentation.

